    Fix for #11687 (Joystick out of screen) + misclick (#11697)
    
    * Fix for #11687 (Joystick out of screen) + misclick
    
    Solves #11687. On large screens, the joystick could appear off-screen.
    Additionally, the reCenter offset has been improved for small screens.
    Now, there is more offset on the side that is near the center, as there
    are no widgets there and is more easy to get there with the thumbs, the
    offset of the side next to the screen boundaries has been decreased.
    
    * Update FlyViewWidgetLayer.qml
    
    * Update JoystickThumbPad.qml
    
