Author: Kimbirlit <p4elovek7@yandex.ru>
Date:   Tue Feb 20 23:00:53 2024 +0300

    Added Airlink support
    How to use it:
    -Go to Comm Links tab
    -Click "Add"
    -In "Type" section select "AirLink"
    -Type in your AirLink credentials and click "Refresh"
    -Select modem ID you want to connect from the list
    -Click "OK"
    Now you can connect via airlink by selecting new connection from connection list in Comm Link tab
    How to remove:
    qmake - uncomment QGC_AIRLINK_DISABLED
    Cmake - set option QGC_AIRLINK_DISABLED on

