Date:   Mon Oct 26 17:48:15 2015 -0200

    Simplify Code
    
    Since it's just a state-toogler, use the return value of the
    method to set the values directly.
    
    Signed-off-by: Tomaz Canabrava <tomaz.canabrava@intel.com>

